  "fields": {
    "contract": "StringExtensions.InputCleaningOptions is a flags selection for StringExtensions.CleanInput. CleanAll = 0 selects default cleaning. AllowEmojis = 1 retains surrogate-pair characters that default cleaning removes. AllowMultiline = 2 converts each LF to CRLF; other control characters, including a standalone CR, remain removed. AllowEmojis and AllowMultiline are independent nonzero flag bits and can be combined.",
